{"parse":{"title":"Master of Weaponry","pageid":16009,"revid":1886869,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><i><div role=\"note\" class=\"notice hatnote context-link about dablink\">This article is about the <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.&#32;For the <a href=\"/wiki/Genius_Invokation_TCG\" title=\"Genius Invokation TCG\">Genius Invokation TCG</a> Event Card, see <a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Weaponry_(Event_Card)\" title=\"Master of Weaponry (Event Card)\">Master of Weaponry (Event Card)</a>.</div></i>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Master of Weaponry</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/45/Talent_Master_of_Weaponry.png/revision/latest?cb=20210607091030\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Master of Weaponry\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/45/Talent_Master_of_Weaponry.png/revision/latest?cb=20210607091030\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/45/Talent_Master_of_Weaponry.png/revision/latest?cb=20210607091030 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/45/Talent_Master_of_Weaponry.png/revision/latest?cb=20210607091030 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Master of Weaponry\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Master_of_Weaponry.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Master of Weaponry.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tartaglia\" title=\"Tartaglia\">Tartaglia</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Level_Increase\" title=\"Talent Level Increase\">Increases</a> your own party members' <a href=\"/wiki/Normal_Attack\" title=\"Normal Attack\">Normal Attack</a> Level by 1.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Level_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level Increase\">Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Level_Increase\" title=\"Talent Level Increase\">Talent Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Normal_Attack_Level_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Normal Attack Level Increase\">Normal Attack Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Master of Weaponry</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Tartaglia\" title=\"Tartaglia\">Tartaglia</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_of_Weaponry%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Tartaglia must be in the active party for Master of Weaponry to take effect, but he does not need to be alive.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Co-Op_Mode\" title=\"Co-Op Mode\">Co-Op Mode</a>, this passive does not apply to other characters outside your own. So it is not possible to stack this beyond Level 11 <a href=\"/wiki/Normal_Attack\" title=\"Normal Attack\">Normal Attack</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_of_Weaponry%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Master of Weaponry</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">诸武精通</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Zhūwǔ Jīngtōng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Mastery of All Martial Arts</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">諸武精通</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Zhūwǔ Jīngtōng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">武芸マスター</span><br /><small><i>Bugei Masutaa</i></small></td><td>Weaponry Master</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">무예</span> <span lang=\"ko\">마스터리</span><br /><small><i>Muye Maseuteori</i></small></td><td>Weaponry Mastery</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Maestro de armas</td><td>Master of Weapons</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Ma<span lang=\"fr\">î</span>trise de l'armement</td><td>Weaponry Mastery</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Мастерское</span> <span lang=\"ru\">владение</span> <span lang=\"ru\">оружием</span><br /><small><i>Masterskoye vladeniye oruzhiyem</i></small></td><td>Masterful Possession of Weapons</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Master of Weaponry</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Tinh Thông\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Tinh Thông</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">精通</span></span>&#8205; &#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Võ Thuật\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Võ Thuật</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">武術</span></span>&#8205;</span></td><td>Expert of Martial Arts</td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Ausgekl<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>gelte Bewaffnung</td><td>Sophisticated Weaponry</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Master of Weaponry</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Mestre do Armamento</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Silah Ustas<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span></td><td>Weapon Master</td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Maestro degli armamenti</td><td>Master of Weaponry</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMaster_of_Weaponry%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/1.1\" title=\"Version/1.1\">Version 1.1</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Master_of_Weaponry/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=1.1&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Master+of+Weaponry\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-s